    <fullName>Conversion_Rule__c</fullName>
    <defaultValue>&apos;Bypass&apos;</defaultValue>
    <description>Per-section conversion directive read by the Form_Submission_Convert_Setup and Process_*_Overridable convert flows to decide which record this section's data builds - e.g. Contact1/Contact2 (with Mailing/Other address sub-actions), Lead1/Lead2, or Case. Bypass skips conversion for this section; the numbered suffixes map to the primary vs secondary record on the submission.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Choose what this section's data should convert into - for example Contact1, Contact2, Lead1, or Case - or Bypass to skip it. The numbered options (Contact1 vs Contact2) target the primary and secondary record on the submission.</inlineHelpText>
